{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24604","headline":"不出门 · 白居易","name":"不出门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弥月不出门，永日无来宾。\n食饱更拂牀，睡觉一嚬伸。\n轻箑白鸟羽，新簟青箭筠。\n方寸方丈室，空然两无尘。\n披衣腰不带，散发头不巾。\n袒跣北窗下，葛天之遗民。\n一日亦自足，况得以终身。\n不知天壤内，目我爲何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}